  "ingredients": [
    "2 bunches beet greens, stems removed",
    "1 tablespoon extra-virgin olive oil, or to taste",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "0.25 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "salt and freshly ground black pepper to taste",
    "2 lemons, quartered"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add beet greens and cook, uncovered, until tender, about 2 minutes, and drain in a colander.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QS4GNvmeiEQctDAr9trMVSEpCkY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/215506-SimpleAndDeliciousBeetGreens-mfs-Step1-1518-743d7000f84a4496a6b92e076536f4d1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215506/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Immediately immerse in ice water for several minutes to stop the cooking process.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sU_C5J60hBhwUJKA9TwOR34nmGQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/215506-SimpleAndDeliciousBeetGreens-mfs-Step2-1520-510982faff594e8d88e252adfecd639a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215506/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the greens are cold, drain well, and coarsely chop.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aMA5JMYDtQK5yrn6EJVCquAr8PI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/215506-SimpleAndDeliciousBeetGreens-mfs-Step3-1529-1611d45cfb204b0681eb8b807de34a43.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215506/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Stir in garlic and red pepper flakes; cook and stir until fragrant, about 1 minute. Stir in the chopped greens until coated, then season with salt and pepper. Cook just until greens are hot; 1 to 2 minutes. Serve with lemon wedges.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
